  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stakeholder workshops - strategic frames</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the process of formulating strategic frameworks for the Danish engagement in Bangladesh, Myanmar and Afghanistan respectively, Danish stakeholder interests will be mapped in order to inform the choices made about the Danish engagement. 

The strategic frameworks will cover all Danish interests and instruments and, as far as Denmark&#x2019;s development engagement is concerned, also set out objectives and outcomes and prioritize all instruments. The strategic framework will decide which instruments to use and in which areas in order to reach its strategic objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
